          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Montezuma's Revenge featuring Panama Joe",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "PANAMA JOE, That’s what they call him ‘round these parts; though no one knows his real name or where he comes from. But one thing’s for sure, PANAMA JOE’s a daredevil from the word “go!” No risk’s too great if the reward’s large enough. Winning. That’s what’s the most important to him. And more times than not, that’s exactly what he does. Because he’s tough, clever – resourceful. And sometimes, downright pig-headed! Though occasionally (ah-hum), he’s been known to get in over his head. Luckily, he’s got a knack for getting himself out of hot water as quickly as he gets into it! Let’s hope MONTEZUMA’S REVENGE is one of those times.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "PANAMA JOE: así lo llaman por estos lares, aunque nadie conoce su verdadero nombre ni de dónde viene. Pero una cosa es segura: PANAMA JOE es un temerario desde el primer momento. No hay riesgo demasiado grande si la recompensa es lo bastante grande. Ganar: eso es lo que más le importa. Y casi siempre lo consigue. Porque es duro, astuto, ingenioso y, a veces, ¡terriblemente cabezota! Aunque de vez en cuando (ejem), se le ha visto meterse en líos mayores de lo que puede manejar. Por suerte, tiene don para salir de los apuros tan rápido como se mete en ellos. ¡Esperemos que MONTEZUMA’S REVENGE sea una de esas veces!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1984",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
